        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saab JAS 39 Gripen, Volvo RM12\n- Concepts: Mach number, top speed, speed of sound, fluid dynamics\n\nFacts:\n- The Saab JAS 39 Gripen is powered by the Volvo RM12.\n- The Saab JAS 39 Gripen has a top speed of Mach 2.\n- In fluid dynamics, the Mach number, abbreviated M or Ma, is a dimensionless quantity.\n- The Mach number represents the ratio of flow velocity past a boundary to the local speed of sound.",
